## User Persona
- General
    - Who want to learn about a specific or multiple topics
    - Can select topics that they want to learn, or randomly ask too.
- Students
    - University or higher education students who have active courses to learn 
    - They want to summarize what they learned or will learn in the near future, based on course materials and recordings (optionally)